    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIN CARDS</strong> is a horror-themed card game where you must build the ultimate deck to survive the nightmares of the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/e4a2a3be51981efd4aa74284688592b3.avif?t=1754381400\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCombine strategy and luck as you collect and purchase powerful cards, craft deadly combos, and face off against terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/603c46e5682abaea78b926526264e696.avif?t=1754381400\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDemons gradually grow stronger and more aggressive under the control of Delilah, the sinister voice of the Netherworld, a manipulative and mocking presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/9b977a6487a69944b3f1387e27a9d572.avif?t=1754381400\" width=170 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEach level introduces increasing difficulty and new mechanics like crafting, mining, and fishing. Craft hero items using resources and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/e092262e33fdcd62ac663b998ff1b3bc.avif?t=1754381400\" width=230 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPersistent Skilltree, Sin Coin Slots, Roulette-Style Games and Lore Expansions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/80155527c32bafeccd3f6209b2a99284.avif?t=1754381400\" width=120 height=182 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/73febadf058ce2e38e870b58221b7227.avif?t=1754381400\" width=236 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/f7304c451718abcec2d04b758f4edf3e.avif?t=1754381400\" width=312 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEach new level reveals more lore about the Sin Cards and the demons that inhabit the world.\u00a0Some say the choices you make reveal the lengths you're willing to go to <span class=\"bb_strike\">survive</span> permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/18bad826d0e7278c90f43c9288f359ad.webp?t=1754381400\" width=45 height=77 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIN CARDS</strong> is a horror-themed card game where you must build the ultimate deck to survive the nightmares of the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/e4a2a3be51981efd4aa74284688592b3.avif?t=1754381400\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCombine strategy and luck as you collect and purchase powerful cards, craft deadly combos, and face off against terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/603c46e5682abaea78b926526264e696.avif?t=1754381400\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDemons gradually grow stronger and more aggressive under the control of Delilah, the sinister voice of the Netherworld, a manipulative and mocking presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/9b977a6487a69944b3f1387e27a9d572.avif?t=1754381400\" width=170 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEach level introduces increasing difficulty and new mechanics like crafting, mining, and fishing. Craft hero items using resources and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/e092262e33fdcd62ac663b998ff1b3bc.avif?t=1754381400\" width=230 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPersistent Skilltree, Sin Coin Slots, Roulette-Style Games and Lore Expansions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/80155527c32bafeccd3f6209b2a99284.avif?t=1754381400\" width=120 height=182 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/73febadf058ce2e38e870b58221b7227.avif?t=1754381400\" width=236 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/f7304c451718abcec2d04b758f4edf3e.avif?t=1754381400\" width=312 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEach new level reveals more lore about the Sin Cards and the demons that inhabit the world.\u00a0Some say the choices you make reveal the lengths you're willing to go to <span class=\"bb_strike\">survive</span> permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/18bad826d0e7278c90f43c9288f359ad.webp?t=1754381400\" width=45 height=77 /></span></p>",
